      "created_at": "2016-04-06T14:26:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So a discussion about OblivAeon pointed out that, because the Sentinels all have the same Nemesis icon, they should do Nemesis damage to one another.</p><p>So, given the wording on Hippocratic Oath, if you chose Dr. Medico to do damage to Mainstay, would the Nemesis bonus be included in the amount that he heals? Or does the healing preempt the damage calculation?</p><p>Related question: Do damage buffs like Inspiring Presence or Obsidian Field affect how much Dr. Medico heals someone with Hippocratic Oath?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:13.633Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
