      "created_at": "2016-04-06T14:29:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If Dr Medico is hitting another member of the Sentinels then yes the healing would increase by one. &nbsp; Any other damage buffs would also increase what he is healing when Dr Medico would deal damage. &nbsp;</p>",
