      "created_at": "2016-04-07T14:16:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, you work out how much damage would be dealt, but when you get to the point where you would remove hp from the target, you add them instead. It's the same with, say, Ab'Zero when he deals himself cold damage when both the Focused Apertures and NPCU are out :).</p>",
