      "created_at": "2016-04-07T14:25:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The target of the damage does not need to be the target of the healing.  So even if Medico wants to heal another hero  (like Scholar) he could select one of the Sentinels for the damage (excluding himself) and still get the boosted healing.</p>",
